#: ../../source/docs/pdf-guides.rst:5 95b54ef5326044ec9a1df347d198edec
msgid "Archived: PDF Guides"
msgstr "已归档：PDF 指南"

#: ../../source/docs/pdf-guides.rst:7 6b9ff3d066a34af5ac133fcca7d3299c
msgid ""
"The following links provide PDF file downloads which can be printed and used"
" as guides and checklists. These cover installing and using the APM2 or PX4 "
"in Multicopters."
msgstr "以下链接提供可打印和用作指南及检查清单的 PDF 文件下载，涵盖在多旋翼飞行器中安装和使用 APM2 或 PX4 的相关内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/pdf-guides.rst:11 c3b61b987d33485c9667a9e1d03c05ff
msgid ""
"We would greatly appreciate any feedback on these printable guides. Please "
"report any errors, or omissions as well as your ideas for additional topics "
"or other thoughts on the APM Forum Linked from the bottom of this page."
msgstr "我们非常欢迎对这些可打印指南提出任何反馈意见。请在本页底部链接的 APM 论坛中报告任何错误、遗漏，以及您对其他主题的想法或其他意见。"

#: ../../source/docs/pdf-guides.rst:16 62d42bc6e20c4ef9a7d7c222958dc652
msgid ""
"`APM2_Quad_Setup_3 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_Setup_3.pdf>`__"
" - Guide for the Installation and Setup of the APM2 in a Quadcopter."
msgstr ""
"`APM2_Quad_Setup_3 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_Setup_3.pdf>`__"
" - APM2 在四旋翼飞行器中的安装与设置指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/pdf-guides.rst:18 35c0d30bb14b4bf4a6d9714c8a860e9e
msgid ""
"`APM2_Flamewheel_Quad_Setup1 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Flamewheel_Quad_Setup1.pdf>`__"
" - Supplemental Guide For Setting up a DJI Flamewheel F450 Quadcopter with "
"the APM2."
msgstr ""
"`APM2_Flamewheel_Quad_Setup1 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Flamewheel_Quad_Setup1.pdf>`__"
" - 使用 APM2 设置 DJI Flamewheel F450 四旋翼飞行器的补充指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/pdf-guides.rst:21 daef3964f45048d280bc9ac4fb80025b
msgid ""
"`APM2_Quad_Stabilize_1 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_Stabilize_1.pdf>`__"
" - Guide for flying a Quadcopter in Stabilize mode and for initial PID "
"adjustment."
msgstr ""
"`APM2_Quad_Stabilize_1 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_Stabilize_1.pdf>`__"
" - 在 Stabilize 模式下飞行四旋翼飞行器及初始 PID 调整指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/pdf-guides.rst:24 de4e477b923d4e4b877d7bc978eb76d4
msgid ""
"`APM2_Quad_AltHold_Loiter_1 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_AltHold_Loiter_1.pdf>`__"
" - Guide for flying a Quadcopter in Altitude Hold, Loiter and Position modes"
" and for initial PID adjustment."
msgstr ""
"`APM2_Quad_AltHold_Loiter_1 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_Quad_AltHold_Loiter_1.pdf>`__"
" - 在 AltHold、Loiter 和 Position 模式下飞行四旋翼飞行器及初始 PID 调整指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/pdf-guides.rst:27 b0aeee8316934536a6fdf0c23a244410
msgid ""
"`APM2_PID_MAP_4 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_PID_MAP_4.pdf>`__"
" - Table of PID assignments for the PID, Configuration and Parameters Lists "
"in the Mission Planner as of 9/1/2012 for Copter Release 2.7.2."
msgstr ""
"`APM2_PID_MAP_4 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/APM2_PID_MAP_4.pdf>`__"
" - Mission Planner 中 PID 分配、配置和参数列表的 PID 对照表，适用于 2012 年 9 月 1 日 Copter 2.7.2"
" 版本。"
